---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<footer
  id="contact"
  class="w-full py-12 px-4 border-t border-gray-200 bg-white"
  role="contentinfo"
>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-bold">
          <img
            src="/thalassokipos_logo.png"
            alt="Θαλασσόκηπος logo"
            class="w-8 h-8 object-contain"
          />
          Θαλασσόκηπος
        </span>
        <p class="text-slate-800">
          Ιχθυοπωλεία Δημητριάδη · Premium Fish Market Θεσσαλονίκη
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Επικοινωνία</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>Τηλέφωνο: 2310 228335 / 2310 235220</li>
          <li>
            Τοποθεσία: 1ο: Βλάλη & Μενεξέ 19 - 2ο: Ασκητού 45, Καπάνι
            Θεσσαλονίκη
          </li>
          <li>Νέα τοποθεσία: Κομνηνών 28, Θεσσαλονίκη</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Ακολουθήστε μας
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/thalassokipos_skg/"
              class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Follow us on Instagram (opens in new tab)"
            >
              <Icon
                name="tabler:brand-instagram"
                class="w-5 h-5"
                aria-hidden="true"
              />
              <span>Instagram</span></a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://www.facebook.com/dimitriadisfish/?locale=el_GR"
              class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Follow us on Facebook (opens in new tab)"
            >
              <Icon
                name="tabler:brand-facebook"
                class="w-5 h-5"
                aria-hidden="true"
              />
              <span>Facebook</span></a
            >
          </li>
          <!-- <li>
            <a
              href="/contact"
              class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors"
            >
              <Icon name="tabler:mail" class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true" />
              <span>Email</span></a
            >
          </li> -->
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative w-full h-96">
      <iframe
        class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full"
        src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3027.7354356791257!2d22.94015308485887!3d40.63571615896448!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x14a839a817d46863%3A0xf96c1a907008b63f!2sDimitriadis%20Fish%20-%20Thalassokipos!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sgr!4v1773062987196!5m2!1sen!2sgr"
        frameborder="0"
        style="border:0;"
        allowfullscreen=""
        aria-hidden="false"
        tabindex="0"
      >
      </iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 text-center text-gray-600">
      <p>
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Θαλασσόκηπος - Ιχθυοπωλεία Δημητριάδη ·
        Premium Fish Market Θεσσαλονίκη. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
